From cc0001bf5cf86541e1d1ef1b910b11579ec1ce73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: minhtritt1996 <minhtritt1996@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 03:02:56 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] audio: bring up TFA9874 speaker and WCD938x SoundWire mic on
 picasso (SM7250)

- Initialize TFA9874 amplifier via I2C at 0x34 with GPIO58 reset.
- Support Bolero 1.2 and SoundWire master port mapping on SM7250 (ADC1 on Master Port 2).
- Route WCD938x TX macro / ADC1 / Bolero SoundWire stream to APR capture.
- Add userland /dev/hakios-audio and /dev/hakios-mic device nodes and test utilities.
- Verified both speaker playback and mic capture on live picasso hardware.
